title: Dashboard › Requests table › Order, rows and paging
route: /dashboard
intro: The 'Requests' card. Rows come in the app's own order until a heading is clicked. A click on a row, a case ID or 'Open' opens the request drawer and adds one history entry. Eight rows show at a time.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Dashboard is open\n'Requests' card under the stage strip"
screen sc1 "Card header\n'Requests' and 'Bars show progress: Prepared, Received, In review, Decided...'\nRight side: 'Showing 8 of 40'"
screen sc2 "Seven columns\nCase, Payer, Where it is, Clock, At stake, What happens next, and an unnamed column with 'Open'"
process p1 "The headings Case, Payer, Where it is, Clock and At stake are buttons that sort the rows\n'What happens next' and the Open column do not sort"
process p2 "Rows start in the app's order\n1 needs you, 2 very late, 3 late, 4 denial with under 2 days left, 5 the rest\nSame group: longest time in stage first"
decision d0 "Do any rows match the filters?"
screen em "'No requests match'\nwith 'Clear filters'"

group gRow "One row (example: P-1499)"
  screen r1 "Row\nCase ID and type, payer and program, chip and bars, clock, At stake, what happens next, 'Open'"
  click c1 "Click anywhere on the row"
  click c2 "Click the underlined case ID, e.g. 'P-1499'"
  click c3 "Click 'Open' on the row"
endgroup
process p3 "Address gets ?request=P-1499\nOne new history entry, so one press of the browser Back button closes the drawer"
overlay o1 "Request drawer opens on the right"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Read a row: bars, clock and what happens next"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Filters › Clear filters and empty states"
goto g4 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Sort the rows"
goto g5 "Continues in: Dashboard › Stage strip › Click a stage tile"

decision d1 "Are there more rows than are shown?"
screen sc3 "Under the table\n'Show 8 more' and '32 not shown'"
click c4 "Click 'Show 8 more'"
process p5 "Eight more rows are added\nWith fewer than 8 left the button shows that number, e.g. 'Show 5 more'"
end e1 "All rows shown\n'Showing 40 of 40'; no button"
process p6 "Changing any filter, the date range or the sort goes back to the first 8 rows"
toast t1 "Count text 'Showing 8 of 40'\nWith Appeal or call: 'Showing 8 of 8 · $67.8K at stake'"
screen sc4 "With the Preparing tile chosen\nA line under the table: '2 more are being prepared in New case.' and 'Open Active cases'"

s1 --> sc1 --> sc2 --> p1 --> p2 --> d0
d0 -->|No| em --> g3
d0 -->|Yes| r1
r1 --> c1 & c2 & c3
c1 --> p3
c3 --> p3
c2 --> p3
p3 --> o1 --> g1
r1 -.-> g2
p1 -.-> g4
d0 -->|Yes| d1
sc1 -.-> t1
d1 -->|Yes| sc3 --> c4 --> p5 --> d1
d1 -->|No| e1
sc3 -.-> p6
d1 -.-> sc4 -.-> g5
